{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣男神霍建華近日為主演的醫療影集《急診室的奇迹》接受網上頻道訪問。</p><p>向來作風低調的他，在訪談中意外曝光自己的養生作息，除了「晚上7、8點」就上床睡覺，清晨5、6點起床會到公園散步、做運動，竟比「9點半準時就寢」的天后蔡依林還要早睡。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T08:23:58.778523+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:46:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T08:17:14.758586+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T08:17:14.758586+00:00","content_hash":"e7c361039963a4e29368444eb025e0eb311df610c73a4cdfd572642508d778b2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}